              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Cataphracts have hand weapon, heavy armour and kontos. May have Cataphract armour (+1) and barding (+4). Cataphracts.

Horse archers have hand weapon and composite bow. Skirmishers. Nomad Horsemen.

There must be at least three times as many horse archer figures as Cataphract figures in the army.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
